# ================================================================
# epsihome-main-site — Environment Variables Reference
# ================================================================
# This application has NO environment variables.
#
# This is intentional — not an oversight.
#
# The epsihome-main-site is a fully static React/Vite marketing
# website. It has:
#   - No backend API calls
#   - No authentication
#   - No external service integrations
#   - No import.meta.env.VITE_* references in any source file
#
# It consists entirely of:
#   - Static React components
#   - i18next for internationalization (locale files in public/)
#   - Tailwind CSS styling
#   - Vite build configuration
#
# The build output is a folder of plain HTML, CSS, and JS files
# that can be served by any static host or Nginx without any
# runtime configuration.
#
# If you add API calls or external service integrations in the
# future, document the required VITE_* variables here.
# ================================================================
